@startuml SequenceAuth
title Sequence Diagram - First-time Password Change

actor Tenant
participant "Mobile App" as UI
participant "AuthController" as Controller
participant "AuthService" as Service
participant "UserRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

Tenant -> UI : Login with default password (phone / 123456)
UI -> Controller : POST /api/auth/login
Controller -> Service : login(username, password)
Service -> Repo : findByUsername(username)
Repo -> DB : SELECT users
DB --> Repo : User
Repo --> Service : User
Service --> Controller : AuthResponse [isFirstLogin=true]
Controller --> UI : 200 OK
UI -> UI : Route to ChangePasswordScreen

Tenant -> UI : Submit old & new password
UI -> Controller : POST /api/auth/change-password
Controller -> Service : changePassword(userId, old, new)
Service -> Repo : findById(userId)
Service -> Service : verify old password
Service -> Repo : update passwordHash, isFirstLogin=false
Repo -> DB : UPDATE users
Service --> Controller : success
Controller --> UI : 200 OK
UI --> Tenant : Redirect to Tutorial/Home

@enduml
